nt\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-A'raaf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/7.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 137\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/7-137.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/7.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;raaf</a> › Aya 137</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:137</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَأَوْرَثْنَا الْقَوْمَ الَّذِينَ كَانُوا يُسْتَضْعَفُونَ مَشَارِقَ الْأَرْضِ وَمَغَارِبَهَا الَّتِي بَارَكْنَا فِيهَا وَتَمَّتْ كَلِمَتُ رَبِّكَ الْحُسْنَىٰ عَلَىٰ بَنِي إِسْرَائِيلَ بِمَا صَبَرُوا وَدَمَّرْنَا مَا كَانَ يَصْنَعُ فِرْعَوْنُ وَقَوْمُهُ وَمَا كَانُوا يَعْرِشُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma Muka gãdar da mutãnen, waɗanda sun kasance anã raunana su, a gabacin ƙasa da yammacinta, wadda Muka sanya albarka a cikinta, kuma kalmar Ubangijinka mai kyau ta cika a kan Banĩ Isrã&#x27;ĩla, sabõda abin dasuka yi na haƙuri. Kuma Muka murtsuke abin da Fir&#x27;auna da mutãnensa suka kasance sunã sanã&#x27;antawa, da abin da suka kasance sunã shimfiɗãwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">بارك في أرض الشام في آيات<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/32</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإنما دمر ما بنوه وعرشوه فأما الأعراض التي قامت بهم فتلك فنيت قبل أن يغرقوا<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/17</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s7a137\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/7-131.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (7:131)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/7-143.html\">Aya ta gaba (7:143)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/7-143.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:143 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma a lõkacin da Mũsã ya jẽ ga mĩkatinMu, kuma Ubangijinsa Ya yi masa magana, shi Mũsã ya ce: &quot;Yã Ubangijina! Ka nũna mini in yi dũbi zuwa gare Ka!&quot; Ya ce\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/7-143.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:143 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kuma a lõkacin da Mũsã ya jẽ ga mĩkatinMu, kuma Ubangijinsa Ya yi masa magana, shi Mũsã ya ce: &quot;Yã Ubangijina! Ka nũna mini in yi dũbi zuwa gare Ka!&quot; Ya ce\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-A'raaf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/7.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 143\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/7-143.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/7.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;raaf</a> › Aya 143</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:143</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَمَّا جَاءَ مُوسَىٰ لِمِيقَاتِنَا وَكَلَّمَهُ رَبُّهُ قَالَ رَبِّ أَرِنِي أَنظُرْ إِلَيْكَ قَالَ لَن تَرَانِي وَلَٰكِنِ انظُرْ إِلَى الْجَبَلِ فَإِنِ اسْتَقَرَّ مَكَانَهُ فَسَوْفَ تَرَانِي فَلَمَّا تَجَلَّىٰ رَبُّهُ لِلْجَبَلِ جَعَلَهُ دَكًّا وَخَرَّ مُوسَىٰ صَعِقًا فَلَمَّا أَفَاقَ قَالَ سُبْحَانَكَ تُبْتُ إِلَيْكَ وَأَنَا أَوَّلُ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma a lõkacin da Mũsã ya jẽ ga mĩkatinMu, kuma Ubangijinsa Ya yi masa magana, shi Mũsã ya ce: &quot;Yã Ubangijina! Ka nũna mini in yi dũbi zuwa gare Ka!&quot; Ya ce: &quot;Bã zã ka gan Ni ba, kuma amma ka dũba zuwa ga dũtse, to, idan ya tabbata a wurinsa, to, zã ka gan Ni.&quot; Sa&#x27;an nan a lõkacin da Ubangijinsa, Ya kuranye zuwa ga dũtsen, Ya sanyã shi niƙaƙƙe. Kuma Mũsã ya fãɗi sõmamme. To, a lõkacin da ya farka, ya ce: &quot;TsarkinKa ya tabbata! Nã tũba zuwa gare Ka, kuma ni ne farkon mũminai.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله: {ولما جاء موسى لميقاتنا وكلمه ربه} يقتضي أن الله هو المكلم فكما يمتنع أن يقال: هو متكلم بكلام قائم بغيره يمتنع أن يقال كلم بكلام قائم بغيره.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/514</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا التكليم غير التكليم الأول الذي أرسله به إلى فرعون، وفي هذا التكليم الثاني سأل النظر لا في الأول، وفيه أعطي الألواح، وكان عن مواعدة من الله له، والتكليم الأول لم يكن عن مواعدة<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/61</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s7a143\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/7-137.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (7:137)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/7-144.html\">Aya ta gaba (7:144)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/7-144.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:144 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ya ce: &quot;Ya Mũsã! Lalle ne Nĩ, Nã zãɓe ka bisa ga mutãne da manzanciNa, kuma da maganãTa. Sabõda haka ka riƙi abin da Nã bã ka, kuma ka kasance daga mãsu gõ\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/7-144.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/7-144.html\">\n<li